  "description": "Flightline 24 Plus DS can hang with the best of them. Fully off-road ready, FL 24 Plus DS is built on a solid platform that includes a rust and worry free 6000 series alloy FL3G low profile frame matched to a Suntour XCT Plus suspension fork with a whopping 80mm of travel to help smooth out the bumps. Add to that, it comes complete with Plus size 24x2.6\" tires mounted to wider 32mm alloy double walled rims making the bumps so small you might not even know they were there. Shimano 8sp rapid fire shifter maintains full command over its 8sp 1X drive train helping you to unleash its speed, but when its time to slow down, no worries as FL 24 Plus DS is equipped with all weather and all conditions Promax mechanical disc brakes.\nHaro FL 24\" Plus 6000 Series alloy frame w/ IS disc mount\n1-1/8\" internal Threadless headset\nSuntour XCT HLO DS 26\" fork w/ 80mm travel, post mount\nShimano Altus 8-spd rear derailleur\nShimano Altus RapidFire, 8-spd shifter\nShimano HG-200 8-spd 12-32t cassette\nPromax DSK-300 brakeset w/ 160mm rotors\n32mm alloy DW Disc rims\nPivit alloy cassette 32h hubs\nKenda 24\"x2.60\" Slant 6 tires",
